      "dcDescription": [
        "The cube has a double-sided mirror which is fixed diagonally inside the cube with one side of the mirror having half a Darth Vader head and the other side half of Anakin Skywalker's head. This means that viewed from one side the box appears to have just a Darth Vader floating head and from the other only Anakin's head. The cube was produced as part of a range of Star Wars merchandise by Pizza Hut for their children's meal deals."
      ],
